      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor \n\u0022News from the Middlelands, Master. The disloyal Legions of Unchained Demons are coming this way. The Undead have been successful in pushing them out of the Middlelands and they are seeking refuge in our territories.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Surely they do not realize that these lands are inhabited by US. They will sorely regret this intrusion...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor \n\u0022Furthermore, our spies in the Northlands have located Wotan\u0027s Scroll, Master. We need now send a scout to retrieve it from the Elves, and send more spies to locate the Corrupted Rune.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Master, we have been successful in pushing the Unchained Demons from our territories. They have been retreating towards the west, into the Legions territories. However, the humans are persisting in their feeble attacks.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We should also keep in mind that we know that the Dragons are in possession of the Corrupted Rune. We must find a way to retrieve it, and locate Wotan\u0027s Scroll, to finally have full control of the land.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Aragonia",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Aragonia",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves \n\u0022The Elves will never let their land be massacred like this, you can be sure!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Hermit",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hermit \n\u0022Stay away! I won\u0027t give it to you! I\u0027m warning you, do not come any closer!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Dwarf Mutiny",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, it seems the Mine Workers are refusing to work! They say that they will not serve us any longer. We must strike down these Unfaithfuls. Discipline is the only language they understand!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Statue Healing",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc East Dragon",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dragons \n\u0022Leave now with your life, for this is the Dragon\u0027s Domain and all intruders will be eaten alive!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc West Dragon",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dragons \n\u0022Stay away, intruders, if you value your lives. These are the Domains of the Dragons and we will not tolerate outsiders!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Thief Hall",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thieves \n\u0022You may think that you\u0027ve stopped us, but we are everywhere... When you least suspect it...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Burnt",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Master Thug \n\u0022Don\u0027t think this is the last time we will meet, thieves loyal to us will fight you until the bloody end...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Get Rune",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Finally, we have the Corrupted Rune. Now we must find the legendary scroll!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Get Scroll",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The Scroll is ours! We must now  seek out the Rune.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022A band of Orcs seem to have set up camp ahead, Milord. We should be careful, they tend to be quite aggressive.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loot Crumbled Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The thieves have left a map here, Milord... It seems there are more thief settlements to the south.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Timoria",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Defenders of the Faith \n\u0022Unfaithfuls... You will not be spared when the Dragons unleash the Rune!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Cultists",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The insane cultists have been burning our towns... They must be dealt with immediately.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Ruined Prison Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This tower was used to keep the heretics and the insane... There are strange runestone markings on the wall, written in blood...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Khu\u0027brah",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Primitive Giants \n\u0022Arghhh!!! Why you come to us??? We want eat you!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Elves",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Elves have been spotted in the area, there is no doubt that they are watching our every move\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Defenders of Faith",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Defenders of Faith \n\u0022Halt, Unfaithfuls! Surrender to us and we will show you the true path!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Primitive Giant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Primitive Giants \n\u0022Arrrgh!, come near, you be food now!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Unfaithful",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Unfaithful \n\u0022I have travelled far and tried to find my faith once again, yet I have found nothing. I now search only for food and shelter... Allow me to serve you and you will not regret your decision...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Many Humans, unfaithful to the Highfather, inhabit the surrounding areas, Milord. They cooperate with the local thugs in numerous raids on our parties.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Under torture, we have learned from a captured Human that the Rune that we seek may in fact be found with the Elves, far to the north-east. We should immediately dispatch a party to retrieve it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Milord, the Hermits of the surrounding areas, in cooperation with the Giants to the North,  are planning to launch an offensive on our territories. We should deal with them as soon as possible!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Some of our merchants have heard rumours that the Rune we seek is in  the possession of the mighty Dragons. I\u0027m afraid, Sir, that we may have to take it by force...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Draco Training Camp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "Every famous Dragon Warrior has trained here!",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Chrulen\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "I think we can make a deal...",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Leif\u0027s Magic Shoppe",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "If magic of protection is what you need, you\u0027ve come to the right place.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Thurin\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My items are the best in the realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Dennar\u0027s Camp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "We will join your army, for a price.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0005",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Thurin\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0005",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "How may I help you stranger?",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0006",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Leia\u0027s Sanctuary",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S236SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S236SI0006",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
